# Files LuaJIT's own build generates in this directory. cmake/luajit/ generates
# them into the build tree instead and refuses to configure if any turn up here
# -- see the stale-file guard in cmake/luajit/CMakeLists.txt and Doc/LUAJIT.md.

# Generated headers and sources
luajit
luajit.h
luajit_relver.txt
lj_bcdef.h
lj_ffdef.h
lj_libdef.h
lj_recdef.h
lj_folddef.h
lj_vm.[sS]

# Compiled output. Nothing here is ever committed: the CMake build never writes
# to this tree, and the precompiled bundles for Projucer users live in
# ../precompiled/ and are never copied in here. *.o/*.lib/*.dll are already
# covered by the root .gitignore; *.a is NOT, which is how libluajit.a came to
# be committed once before (removed in d1168d3f / 5dc9defe).
*.o
*.obj
*.a
*.lib
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
host/*.o
host/*.obj
